OL,3,GNEWSA'I had no idea there was a WW2
OL,4,Ashell in my neighbour's garage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a street which had to be
OL,7,Fevacuated after a World War Two mortar
OL,8,Fshell was found during a house
OL,9,Fclearance have said they were "shocked"
OL,10,Fat the unexpected discovery.
OL,12,FAn Army bomb disposal unit had to be
OL,13,Fcalled to safely detonate the device
OL,14,Fafter it was discovered at a property
OL,15,Fon Robin Hood Crescent in Edenthorpe,
OL,16,FDoncaster, on Thursday 12 November.
OL,18,FNeighbours said until police told them
OL,19,Fto leave their homes they had no idea
OL,20,Fthe ordnance was inside the garage of
OL,21,Fthe semi-detached property, which had
OL,22,Fbelonged to an elderly couple.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
